<P align=center style='font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0'>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=center style='font:18pt Times New Roman;margin:0'><FONT style='border-bottom:1px solid #000000'><B>Utah Medical Products, Inc.</B></FONT></P>
