<P style='font:10pt Times New Roman;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:0pt'><B>Additional disclosure regarding dilution from equity awards:</B></P>
<P style='font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0'>&nbsp;</P>
<P style='font:10pt Times New Roman;margin:0'>In 2013, stockholders approved a ten-year incentive stock option plan for employees and directors. &nbsp;In 2023 the board of directors approved a new five-year non-qualified stock option plan for employees and directors. &nbsp;The dilutive impact to stockholders of stock option awards under the 2013 and 2023 plans is provided in the following table.</P>
